  "conclusions": [
    {
      "text": "The retained 2017 geoBoundaries KIR ADM1 file contains three features with 29 Gilbert, 11 Phoenix and 5 Line source components; the exact source bytes and per-part bounds are reproducible.",
      "status": "supported",
      "source_ids": [
        "geoBoundaries-KIR-ADM1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 19 Atlas Table 5 Gilbert entries are census/reporting rows rather than a one-to-one physical-island geometry inventory; the present source and retained Atlas subject parts do not establish exact row-to-island boundaries.",
